        "rationale": "The source text states that 'it shall not be an unlawful employment practice for a school, college, university, or other educational institution or institution of learning to hire and employ employees of a particular religion' under specified circumstances. Because this relieves a statutory prohibition rather than an affirmative duty, the proper deontic classification is permission ('may') rather than lack of obligation ('not_required'). Proposal P0000 fixes this defect in modal force while accurately preserving the statutory terms, actors, and disjunctive conditions.",
